 "day_note": "Dayparts (Niko, 31 Oct 2026): cartoons from 06:00 to 13:30; the afternoon is the matinee (silent comedy, serials, then comedy and westerns on alternate days) until 19:00; prime time from 19:00 is the great classics and adventure, then noir at 22:00; the madrugada is horror, science fiction / cult / documentaries and classic TV. Sized to the shelves: a block's hours on the shelf / its hours a day = days before its first rerun (tools/rotation.py). 'a|b|c' alternates blocks day by day; a slot must be longer than its block's longest title, or that title never airs.",
 "epoch": "2026-10-31",
 "epoch_note": "tools/build.py winds each block's tape from this date, day by day; leave it, or every date's line-up moves.",
 "breaks_note": "breaks: features (films of 40 minutes or more) go to a break about every 25 minutes, at the places tools/breaks.py found (catalog/breaks.json). Since 31 Oct 2026 (Niko) a break is only the INTERVALO card and VOLTAMOS (~10 s): no trailers, no promos, no sponsor slot. Future spots (the Estúdio's anúncios, with Niko's own voice-over) need room: \"hold\" = seconds of the station card in each break, which the spots replace. tools/segments.py also takes \"slot\", \"promos\", \"trailers\": true, \"idents\": true. Shorts, cartoons and episodes play straight. \"on\": false puts every feature back in one piece.",
